      "created_at": "2015-01-07T20:41:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, here's a conundrum.</p><p>Currently, I own every deck that's been sold for the SotM game--all the expansions and mini-expansions, as well as quite a few of the promos.</p><p>As it sits right now, I have these cards in two boxes: &nbsp;the SotM EE box (which holds all of the Heroes and the Environments) and the Vengeance box (which holds all of the Villains and oversized villain cards). &nbsp;I use one of the smaller expansion boxes to hold tokens and promo cards.</p><p>Right now, I can probably fit 2 more Hero decks and 2 more Environment decks in my SotM-EE box. &nbsp;Concurrently, I could probably fit 4 full Villain decks in the Vengeance box. &nbsp;Or, perhaps, a set of 5 Vengeance-style villains.</p><p><span>I submit to you, ladies and gentlemen: &nbsp;the next expansion for Sentinels of the Multiverse will be the final one, as nothing more will fit in my boxes!</span></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:13.515Z",
