      "id": 125737,
      "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
      "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-07T21:04:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, heck--since I've already given my guesses above, I might as well throw out some<em> completely too-early&nbsp;italicised </em>(not&nbsp;<strong>bold</strong>)&nbsp;<em>predictions</em> for the next/final expansion:</p><ol>\n<li>Our theme this time will be \"unlikely alliances at the End of the World\". &nbsp;I picture something like the final two episodes of Justice League Unlimited, where Lex Luthor joins with Superman to fight Darkseid.</li>\n<li>Our heroes will be hero-fied versions of Baron Blade and The Matriarch. &nbsp;It'd make a nice completion to the Baron Blade arc, and there's already been a ton of foreshadowing regarding The Matriarch as a hero.</li>\n<li>Our major villain will be the Cosmic Entity--a Galactus-style world-ending creature, who we'll fight through his Heralds: &nbsp;something like a SotM version of the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse. &nbsp;We've already seen him in Nightmist's deck, but he'll be a Vengeance-style villain, but one that you can't directly attack until his Heralds are destroyed.</li>\n<li>One of the environments will be The Center of the Multiverse (or something similar), which will play somewhat like the Realm of Discord or the Time Cataclysm--lots of constantly shifting terrain, a handful of targets, but lots of weirdness and unpredictability.</li>\n</ol>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:59:59.752Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
