      "raw": "<p>Well, heck--since I&#39;ve already given my guesses above, I might as well throw out some<em> completely too-early&nbsp;italicised </em>(not&nbsp;<strong>bold</strong>)&nbsp;<em>predictions</em> for the next/final expansion:</p><ol><li>Our theme this time will be &quot;unlikely alliances at the End of the World&quot;. &nbsp;I picture something like the final two episodes of Justice League Unlimited, where Lex Luthor joins with Superman to fight Darkseid.</li><li>Our heroes will be hero-fied versions of Baron Blade and The Matriarch. &nbsp;It&#39;d make a nice completion to the Baron Blade arc, and there&#39;s already been a ton of foreshadowing regarding The Matriarch as a hero.</li><li>Our major villain will be the Cosmic Entity--a Galactus-style world-ending creature, who we&#39;ll fight through his Heralds: &nbsp;something like a SotM version of the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse. &nbsp;We&#39;ve already seen him in Nightmist&#39;s deck, but he&#39;ll be a Vengeance-style villain, but one that you can&#39;t directly attack until his Heralds are destroyed.</li><li>One of the environments will be The Center of the Multiverse (or something similar), which will play somewhat like the Realm of Discord or the Time Cataclysm--lots of constantly shifting terrain, a handful of targets, but lots of weirdness and unpredictability.</li></ol>",
