      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-08T13:56:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Early on, I was seeing some dings on the card dividers and started using tape on the top to protect them. No issues since I did that.</p><p>Bending hasn't been a problem as I don't put anything on top of them. I've only seen that in other folks' sets (or demo sets) when bags of the tokens / HP counters are put on top. I use the large section in the Vengeance box (for now) to avoid that.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
